## 8. Planned vs. used

| Original plan        | Used instead                         | Why                                               |
| -------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Next.js              | React + Vite                         | Simple SPA with a separate API; fast dev server   |
| ShadCN UI            | Radix primitives + custom styling    | Kept only what is used; avoids the template look  |
| Node.js + Express    | Django + DRF                         | Built-in admin, ORM, migrations and auth          |
| Prisma               | Django ORM                           | Comes with Django                                 |
| NextAuth.js          | Simple JWT                           | Works with a separate frontend                    |
| PDFKit / Puppeteer   | ReportLab                            | Pure Python, no headless browser needed           |
| Cloudinary           | Django file uploads                  | Enough at this scale                              |
| Google Analytics, Sentry | Not added yet                    | Listed in todo.md                                 |

